Package: nflog2syslog
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 adduser,
Conflicts: nflog-to-syslog
Replaces: nflog-to-syslog
Description: NFLOG to JSON-to-syslog transport daemon
 nflog2syslog reads packets from the kernel's NFLOG netfilter target via
 netlink, dissects them into protocol layers (IPv4/IPv6, TCP/UDP, ICMP,
 GRE, DNS, DHCP and more), and forwards one JSON object per packet to
 syslog (local socket, UDP or TCP). A stalled syslog server causes
 counted drops instead of blocking the kernel socket.
